              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yasisithi kuMozisi: Yelulela isandla sakho ezulwini, ukuze kube lobumnyama phezu kwelizwe leGibhithe, yebo, ubumnyama obuphathekayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
